<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ñaareelu bataaxal bi Yàlla may Pool, <optbreak /> mu bind ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Man Pool, ndawul Yeesu Kirist ci coobarey Yàlla, ngir xamle dund gi nu Yàlla dig te féete ci Kirist Yeesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />maa ngi lay bind, Timote, sama doomu diine ji ma bëgg. Na la Yàlla Baay bi ak Kirist Yeesu sunu Boroom may yiw, yërmande ak jàmm.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feddalil sa ngëm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Fu ma tollu maa ngi lay boole ci samay ñaan, di ci sant Yàlla, mi may jaamu ci xel mu dal, ni ko samay maam daan defe. Guddi ak bëccëg, bu sama xel demee ci say rongooñ, <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />ma bëgg laa gis, ba am mbég mu réy. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Maa ngi fàttaliku sa ngëm gu dëggu, gi nekkoon ci sa maam Lowis ak sa yaay Ënis, te mu wóor ma ne sax na ci yaw it. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Looloo tax maa ngi lay fàttali, nga xambaat taal bi Yàlla taal ci yaw, di may gi mu la jagleel, bi ma la tegee samay loxo. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ndaxte Xel mi nu Yàlla sol du ànd ak ragal, waaye day ànd ak kàttan, mbëggeel ak moom sa bopp.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Bul rus ci seedeel sunu Boroom, mbaa ci li ñu ma tëj ndax turam, waaye bokkal ak man tiis ci xamle xibaaru jàmm bi, wéeru ci kàttanu Yàlla. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Moo nu musal te woo nu ci dund gu sell, ci lu ajuwul ci sunuy jëf, waaye ci dogalu boppam ak yiwam, wi nu Yàlla may ci Kirist Yeesu, ba àddina sosoogul. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Te léegi biral na ko ci feeñug sunu Musalkat Kirist Yeesu, mi nasaxal dee te feeñal dund ci xibaaru jàmm bi, te muy dund gu sax. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Te Yàlla fal na ma ndaw ak jànglekat, ngir may yégle xibaar bi; <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />looloo tax ma jànkoonte ak tiis yu mel nii. Waaye rusuma ci, ndaxte xam naa ki ma wékk sama yaakaar, te wóor na ma ne li ma ko dénk, man na koo denc ba bés ba.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Toppal ci tànki wax yu wér yi nga dégge ci man, jàpp ci ak ngëm ak mbëggeel, yi nu am ci sunu bokk ci Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Te nga sàmm bu baax li la Yàlla dénk, wéeru ci Xel mu Sell, mi dëkk ci nun.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Xam nga ne waa diiwaanu Asi gépp won nañu ma gannaaw, ñu deme niki Fusel ak Ermosen. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Waaye Onesifor daa na faral di dëfal sama xol; na Boroom bi sotti yërmandeem ci këram. Rusul woon sax ci samay jéng, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />waaye bi mu ñëwee dëkku Room, wut na ma fu ne, ba gis ma. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Na ko Boroom bi teeru ak yërmandeem ca bés ba. Umplewoo it coono yi mu daj, ngir dimbali ma ca dëkku Efes.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Beyal sa sas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Kon nag yaw sama doomu diine, doolewool yiw, wi ci Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Te wax yi nga dégge ci man fi kanam seede yu bare, nanga leen jottali nit ñu takku, ngir ñoom it ñu mana jàngal ñeneen. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Bokkal ak man tiis, di jàmbaar ci toolu xareb Kirist Yeesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />xam ne xarekat bu bëgga neex ka ko solal, du dugg ci yëfi àddina. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Te it ku tàggat yaramam ngir rawante, duñu ko jagleel kaalag ndam mukk, su toppul sàrt ya. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Noonu it beykat bi sonn mooy jëkka ñam toolam. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Xalaatal bu baax sama wax jii, ndax Boroom bi dina leeral sa xel ci lépp.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Fàttalikul Yeesu Kirist mi dekki, soqikoo ci Daawuda, tukkee ci xibaaru jàmm bi may waare. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Xibaar booboo tax may jànkoonte ak i tiis, ba ñu jéng ma ni defkatu lu bon; waaye kàddug Yàlla moom, kenn du ko jéng. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Te lii tax may muñ lépp, ngir ñi Yàlla tànn it am mucc gi ci Kirist Yeesu, gu ànd ak ndam lu sax.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Kàddu gu wóor a ngii:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">Su nu deeyaalee ak Kirist,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">dinanu dundaat ak moom;<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />su nu takkoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">dinanu nguuru ak moom.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12" />
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Su nu ko weddee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">kon mu weddi nu; <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />su nu ko ñàkkee kóllëre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">moom dina sax ci kóllëreem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">ndax manula weddi boppam.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liggéeykat bu neex Yàlla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Saxal ci di leen fàttali mbir yooyu, di leen dénk fa kanam Yàlla, ñu moytoo werante ciy araf, ndax loolu jëmul fu dul ci yàq ngëmu ñiy déglu. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Góor-góorlul ba teew fa kanam Yàlla, nekk liggéeykat bu mu nangul te rusoo ci dara, di faramfàcce bu jub kàddug dëgg gi. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Moytul bépp jataayu waxi neen yu àddina kese, ndax ña fa toog dinañu gëna xuus cig weddi, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />te seen kàddu day burux ni ngal. Imene ak Filet, ci ñoom lañu bokk; <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />dañoo moy dëgg, di wax ne ndekkite wees na, ba yàq ngëmu ñenn ñi. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Waaye teewul fondamaa bu dëgër, bi Yàlla tabax, nee na kekk, te lii lañu ci tàmpe: «Boroom bi xam na ñi bokk ci moom,» te it: «Ki tudd turu Boroom bi, na daw lu bon.»<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ci kër gu mag nag, du ndabi wurus walla xaalis rekk a fa am, waaye itam yoy dénk walla ban; yii tedd nañu, yee ñàkk solo. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Kon nag ku laabal sa bopp ci yooyu yépp, dinga nekk ndab lu tedd te sell, nga am njariñ ci Boroom bi te jekk ci bépp jëf ju rafet.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Dawal bépp bëgg-bëggu ngone, te sóobu ci njub, ngëm, mbëggeel, jàmm, ànd ak ñépp ñiy tudd turu Boroom bi ak xol bu sell. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Tanqamlul bépp weranteb neen bu amul njariñ, xam ne xuloo rekk lay jur. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Te jaamu Boroom bi warula xuloo, waaye na lewet ci ñépp, jekk ngir jàngle tey muñ fitnay noon. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Na jubbanti cig suufe ñi koy diiŋat, tey yéene Yàlla xiir leen ci réccu, ba ñu xam dëgg; <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />ñu rëcc ci fiirug Seytaane, mi leen jàpp niy jaam, te ñu délsi ci seen xel yu rafet, ba sóobuwaat ci coobarey Yàlla.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Yàqute gi daj mujug jamono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Nanga xam lii: bési tiis yu tar ñu ngi nuy tëru ci mujug jamono. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ndaxte nit ñi dinañu siis te fonk xaalis, di ñu réy tey yég seen bopp, ñuy xaste tey xëtt ndigalu waajur; duñu am kóllëre, sellaay <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />mbaa cofeel; dañuy jàpp mer ak a sos; ñu xér lañuy doon, ñu soxor te bañ lu baax; <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />ay workat lañuy doon, di ñu ëppal te bare tiitar; seen bànneex a leen gënal Yàlla. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Dañuy mbubboo diine waaye nanguwuñu koo dugal seen xol. Ñu deme noonu, dëddu leen.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Nit ñu mel noonu ñooy yoxoosu ci biir kër yi, ba fàbbi jigéen ñu ñàkk pastéef, ñi seeni bàkkaar ub seen bopp, te bëgg-bëgg yu wuute jiital leen. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Duñu noppee gëstu, waaye duñu mana yegg ci xam-xamu dëgg mukk. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Nit ñooñu dañuy bëreek dëgg, ni Sànnes ak Sàmbares bëree woon ak Musaa; ay boroom xel yu gumba lañu, yu seen ngëm tekkiwul dara. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Waaye duñu dem fu sore, ndax seen ñàkk xel dina bir ñépp, ni mu dale woon Sànnes ak Sàmbares.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li Pool dénk Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Waaye yaw nag xam nga bu baax sama njàngle, sama dund, sama takkute, sama ngëm, sama muñ, sama mbëggeel ak sama dékku tiis. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Xam nga li ma daj ciy fitna ak i coono ci dëkki Ancos, Ikoñum ak Listar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ay dëkk ci diiwaanu Galasi lañu woon, fa Pool tàmbalee yenam, biy waare xibaaru Kirist.</char></note>. Céy li ma jànkoonteel ciy fitna! Waaye Boroom bi musal na ma ci lépp. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Te ku bokk ci Kirist Yeesu, te bëgg dund dund gu ànd ak ragal Yàlla, alamikk ñu fitnaal la. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Waaye nit ñu bon ñi ak naaféq yi dinañu fi yées, di naxe ak a nax seen bopp.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Yaw nag saxal ci li nga jàng te mu wóor la, xam fi nga tibbe. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Li dale ci sa ngone xam nga Mbind mu sell, mi la mana yee ci yoonu mucc, jaar ci gëm Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Mbind mu sell mépp, ci gémmiñu Yàlla la jóge, te am na njariñ ngir jàngal nit ñi, yedd leen, jubbanti leen te yee leen ci njub. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Noonu waayu Yàlla ji dina mat, ba jekk ci bépp jëf ju rafet.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Kon nag maa ngi lay dénk fa kanam Yàlla ak Kirist Yeesu, miy àtte ñiy dund ak ñi dee, di la dénk ci feeñam ci biir ndam ak ci nguuram, nga def lii: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />xamleel kàddug Yàlla, sax ci, su neexee ak su naqaree; yeyal ñi tooñ, di yedd ak a dénk ñépp, def ko ci muñ gu yaatu ak njàngle mu mat. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ndaxte jamono dina ñëw, joo xam ne nit ñi dootuñu xajoo njàngle mu wér mi, waaye dinañu jublu ci seeni bëgg-bëgg, di fortaatu jànglekat yu leen di jay. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Dinañu tanqamlu dëgg, jeng jëm ci léebi diiney neen. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Waaye yaw nanga foog ci lépp, dékku tiis, tey tas xibaaru jàmm bi, ba matal sag yónnent.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ndaxte maa ngi ci tànki joxe sama bakkan ni sarax, te sama waxtuw dem jot na. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Bëre naa ba ub làmbi ngëm, daw naa ba àkk, sàmm naa mboolem dëgg, gi ñu ma dénk. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Fi mu ne Yàllaa ngi may xaare añu ku jub, di kaalag ndam gi ma Boroom, biy Àttekat bu jub, di jox ca bés ba, te jéllale naa sama bopp, waaye képp ku def sa xol cig feeñam.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dénkaaney Pool yu mujj ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Defal sa kem kàttan, ba fekksi ma ci ni mu gëna gaawe. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Ndaxte Demas topp na àddina, ba bàyyi ma, dem dëkku Tesalonig; Kereseñsë dem na diiwaanu Galasi, Tit dem diiwaanu Dalmasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luug rekk a des fi man. Indaaleel Màrk, ndaxte amal na ma njariñ ci liggéey bi. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tisig moom yebal naa ko dëkku Efes. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Te sooy ñëw, indaaleel mbubb, ma ma dénkoon Karpus ca dëkku Torowas, te it bul fàtte téere yi, rawatina téere yu am maana, yi ñu bind ci der.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alegsàndar tëgg bi def na ma ñaawteef yu ne, waaye Boroom bi dina ko fey ay jëfam. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Moytu ko bu baax, ndaxte bëre na ak sunuy wax ba tàyyi.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Keroog bi ma jëkkee taxaw, di làyyil sama bopp, awma woon kenn ku ma taxawu, ñépp dañu maa daw-- bu leen ko Yàlla jàppe nag. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Waaye Boroom bi moo ma taxawu te dooleel ma, ma jollil kàddu gi, ba xeet yépp dégg ko. Te Boroom bi musal na ma ci selli gaynde. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Rax-ca-dolli dina ma musal ci bépp jëf ju ñaaw, tette ma ci jàmm, ba tàbbal ma ci nguuram gu kawe ga. Yal na yelloo ndam ba fàww. Amiin.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tàggoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Nuyul ma Piriska ak Akilas ak waa kër Onesifor. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erast des na dëkku Korent. Torofim dafa woppoon, ma bàyyi ko dëkku Mile. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Gaawala ñëw, bala lolli di gàllankoor sa yoon. Ëbulus, Pudeñsë, Linus, Këlójaa ak yeneen bokk yépp ñu ngi lay nuyu. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Yal na Boroom bi aar sa xel. Na yiwu Yàlla ànd ak yéen ñépp.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>